{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prehistoric Fury</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roar, breathe fire, shoot firebolts, dodge and roll mid-air, launch special attacks, and make use of loadouts of suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/Combat_Small.gif?t=1750348151\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Games, Offline vs Bots, &amp; LAN Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the way you want, set your own rules, with or without internet. Offline play earns you the same rewards as multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/CustomGames_Small.gif?t=1750348151\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Dragon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive character &amp; profile customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/Customization_Small.gif?t=1750348151\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fierce Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See where you stack up in the global and regional leaderboard, push yourself to improve and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/Leaderboard_Small.gif?t=1750348151\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One-Time Purchase, Yours to Unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions, no online-only content.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/814330?t=1750348151","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750348151","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst