30/extras/CustomGames_Small.gif?t=1750348151\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Dragon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive character &amp; profile customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/Customization_Small.gif?t=1750348151\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fierce Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See where you stack up in the global and regional leaderboard, push yourself to improve and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/Leaderboard_Small.gif?t=1750348151\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One-Time Purchase, Yours to Unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions, no online-only content.</p>","developers":["Protoria Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/header.jpg?t=1750348151","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Protoria Studios 2024","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> At least 4 Core, 3.0 GHz speed<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 Ti (used in development) / Equivalent and up<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Install to a solid state drive (SSD) for best experience.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8 or more cores, 4.0